# Keep package-lock.json machine-independent.
#
# This repo's lockfile once contained 111 http://mirrors.tencentyun.com URLs,
# baked in from a developer's global registry mirror. The lockfile then only
# installed on that one machine: CI failed with ENOTFOUND because a GitHub
# runner cannot resolve an internal Tencent host, and the tarballs were being
# fetched over plaintext HTTP.
#
# `replace-registry-host=npmjs` lets a developer keep a fast local mirror in
# their own ~/.npmrc while npm still records the canonical npmjs.org URL in the
# lockfile — so mirrors stay a local optimisation instead of a repo-wide defect.
replace-registry-host=npmjs
